<% const format=n=>Number(n).toLocaleString('en-US'),interval=locals.billingInterval==='annual'?'annual':'monthly';const stories={starter:['Run cleanly','Stock, orders and money in one place.'],growth:['Connect your operation','Less routine work across your business.'],pro:['Manage exceptions','Let StockChief act within the limits you approve.'],enterprise:['Fit your operation','Capacity and service agreed for your business.']}; %>
<section class="pricing-intro"><div><span class="pub-kicker">Plans for your business</span><h1>Choose the work StockChief can handle.</h1><p>Inventory, purchasing, sales and accounting in one place. Allowances are shared across your account. Pay by card, with a 14-day money-back guarantee.</p></div><nav aria-label="Billing interval"><a class="pub-btn" href="/pricing?interval=monthly" <%= interval==='monthly'?'aria-current=page':'' %>>Monthly</a> <a class="pub-btn" href="/pricing?interval=annual" <%= interval==='annual'?'aria-current=page':'' %>>Annual · 2 months free</a></nav></section>
<% if(!checkoutOpen){ %><div class="pub-notice">Paid signup is closed on this installation. The plans and included allowances are shown below.</div><% } %><% if(checkoutCancelled){ %><div class="pub-notice">Checkout was cancelled. No subscription was activated.</div><% } %>
<section class="plan-ladder"><% plans.forEach(function(raw,index){const plan=offer.describe(raw),story=stories[plan.id]||stories.starter; %><article class="plan-card plan-card--<%= plan.id %> <%= plan.is_recommended?'is-recommended':'' %>" id="<%= plan.id %>"><header><span class="plan-card__number">0<%= index+1 %></span><div><small><%= story[0] %></small><h2><%= plan.name %></h2></div></header><div class="plan-card__body"><div class="plan-card__promise"><h3><%= story[1] %></h3><div class="plan-price"><% if(plan.sales_only){ %><strong>From $2,000</strong><span>/month</span><% }else{ %><strong>$<%= format(Number(interval==='annual'?plan.annual_amount_minor:plan.monthly_amount_minor)/100) %></strong><span>/<%= interval==='annual'?'year':'month' %></span><small data-price-note><%= interval==='annual'?'Billed annually · 2 months free':'Billed monthly' %></small><% } %></div></div><div class="plan-card__features"><small>INCLUDED IN THIS PLAN</small><ul><% for(const feature of plan.features){ %><li><i>✓</i><span><%= feature.text %></span></li><% } %></ul><div class="plan-card__usage"><ul><% for(const a of plan.allowances){ %><li><strong><%= a.units==null?'Unlimited':format(a.units) %></strong> <%= a.label %><%= ['ai_work_credits','emails_sent'].includes(a.meter)?' / month':'' %></li><% } %></ul><% if(plan.approximateQuestions){ %><p>About <%= format(plan.approximateQuestions) %> typical AI questions or actions per month. Larger files and complex work use more credits. Direct record lookups use no AI credits.</p><% } %></div></div><div class="plan-card__action"><% if(plan.sales_only){ %><a class="pub-btn" href="/contact?plan=enterprise">Discuss Custom</a><% }else if(checkoutOpen){ %><a class="pub-btn" href="/register?plan=<%= plan.id %>&amp;interval=<%= interval %>" data-plan-link data-plan="<%= plan.id %>">Choose <%= plan.name %></a><% }else{ %><a class="pub-btn" href="/contact?plan=<%= plan.id %>">Contact StockChief</a><% } %></div></div></article><% }); %></section>
<section class="qualification-note"><span>Extra capacity and usage</span><h2>Add what your business needs.</h2><div class="pub-addon-grid"><% for(const p of offerPacks){ %><p><strong><%= format(p.units) %> <%= p.category==='ai_work_credits'?'AI credits':'outgoing emails' %></strong> — $<%= format(Number(p.amount_minor)/100) %><% if(p.category==='ai_work_credits'){ %> (about <%= format(Math.floor(Number(p.units)/Number(p.credit_unit_scale||1))) %> typical questions)<% } %></p><% } %><% for(const p of capacityProducts){ %><p><strong><%= p.label %></strong> — $<%= format(Number(p.monthly_amount_minor)/100) %>/month</p><% } %></div><p>Unused included AI credits roll over for one month. Purchased usage expires after 12 months. Auto-top-up is off until you choose a pack and monthly spending cap. We email you at 80% and 100% usage; your core business records remain available when AI credits run out.</p></section>
<section class="qualification-note"><span>Your accounts stay yours</span><h2>Connect the services your business already uses.</h2><p>Your shipping provider bills your own account for postage. Merchant payments reach your connected payment account. Provider access and configuration are required.</p><a href="/integrations">View supported integrations →</a></section>
<section class="qualification-note"><h2>Paid signup. 14-day money-back guarantee.</h2><p>Cancel anytime. Plan changes show their price before you approve them. A successful subscription refund cancels renewal, keeps your workspace read-only with export access for 30 days, then deletes its workspace data.</p><a href="/terms">Read the subscription terms</a></section>
